# Of or relating to [[mediation]].
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1650|author={{w|Francis Cheynell}}|title=The Divine Trinunity of the Father, Son and Holy Spirit|location=London|publisher=S. Gellibrand|page=346|url=https://catalog.hathitrust.org/Record/001939327
